            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Agennix is developing recombinant human (rh) lactoferrin, a glycoprotein with antibiotic, anti-inflammatory and immunomodulatory activity, for the potential treatment of cancers, asthma and chronic wounds. rh Lactoferrin is currently undergoing phase II clinical trials.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
